Cell["\<\
Decorating a tree means choosing an operator for every node and x or an \
integer for every leaf. Three random expressions with 4 internal nodes:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7d780dc6-ac39-4971-829f-ed06079be0cc"],

