Cell["\<\
IBP from a small table. Start with the BWD pairs of a few functions, then \
apply integration by parts to every pair (F, G) of them, three times; each \
round can use what the previous round found.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"76d0b444-ea37-4a4c-92ef-c93b65ea79ef"],

